WEBVTT

00:17:58.204 --> 00:18:00.996
I always describe them. They're the
parents of the block and they,

00:18:01.288 --> 00:18:02.871
you know, interact with you that way.

00:18:02.871 --> 00:18:07.038
They're looking out for you guys as
as kids. It does feel like that.

00:18:07.371 --> 00:18:10.829
Like all of us, Edith and Angelo's world
was turned upside down in March.

00:18:10.829 --> 00:18:14.038
Twenty twenty. They started to
notice people wearing masks

00:18:14.038 --> 00:18:15.663
and talking about working from home

00:18:16.204 --> 00:18:19.288
with a mass of the people coming from
people with a mask and etc. .

00:18:19.621 --> 00:18:23.913
And I said, what's going on here? People
say, well, I want to stay home to work.

00:18:24.288 --> 00:18:27.621
And then we thought that we've got a
problem there. I start getting worried.

00:18:27.954 --> 00:18:31.954
As New York City shut down, their entire
livelihood was now in question.